{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras/202dc920e166077cc982bb67c0192cc2.avif?t=1772180848\" width=800 height=879 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted with passion out of Smokeback 's chaos mind a heart-pounding side-scrolling boss rush shooter that blends retro-inspired design with explosive run-and-boom action packed with adrenaline-pumping combat. Set in the richly <strong>original world of Odspiken</strong>, this isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s an immersive adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras/8d651cc60eeff3bc527dfbd458432102.avif?t=1772180848\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras_big/8d651cc60eeff3bc527dfbd458432102.avif?t=1772180848 width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Odspiken</strong> has been shattered into shineless world of darkness...Once thrived in harmony, as a glittering golden paradise with shiny skies\u2026until the beasts descended from the sky like storms, devouring night and day, draining the lands of all its shine one by one, we fell to their gold driven hunger of the <strong>Goldchest beasts!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time tested and reshaped us to fight back until only one Hunter remained. In our darkest hour, hope ignited with the last  sacred ore left we forged a weapon that became our symbol to reclaim what was lost, the <i>first <strong>Cannonpistol</strong></i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras/ee66a745b7ceff15fb1c2d561fe9ee01.avif?t=1772180848\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras_big/ee66a745b7ceff15fb1c2d561fe9ee01.avif?t=1772180848 width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras/f744f872e4841d8a03d2ac3956fb86ed.avif?t=1772180848\" width=759 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own path and dive into the mesmerizing world of <strong>Odspiken</strong>\u2014a realm with secrets, untold stories to discover in the echoes of\u00a0 shine lost lands . From the treacherous depths of the <strong>Cavemendie</strong> mines to the shadowy expanse of the <strong>Darkrest</strong> forests above <strong>Fognest</strong> and all the way to <strong>Solomonz peak</strong> .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras/f35ea245efbea7d9ac34788290a19b41.avif?t=1772180848\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras_big/f35ea245efbea7d9ac34788290a19b41.avif?t=1772180848 width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras/7c89036c08c6258adfe7c09d369e706b.avif?t=1772180848\" width=800 height=311 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Hunter has a purpose, and in this world, it\u2019s simple: hunt and take down every last <strong>Goldchest beast!</strong> Face beasts unlike anything you\u2019ve ever seen, test your skills, and prove your growth as the last Goldchest Hunter.Fight fiercely, rise to the challenge combining your  attacks and the hunt ends when the last Goldchest beast falls in <strong>Odspiken</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras/8736dbea9962929ac1a5a2046e423cd7.avif?t=1772180848\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras_big/8736dbea9962929ac1a5a2046e423cd7.avif?t=1772180848 width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras/bf792de4b4de96f161fca77d1733dca7.avif?t=1772180848\" width=759 height=470 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key to victory lies in your gear! Power up your <strong>cannonpistol</strong>, explosive cannonballs, and unlock game-changing trinkets, enchanted gear, and magical upgrades to dominate the hunt.Make sure to visit the one and only Nozzedim shop of tools to sharpen your edge and turn the tide in your favor for every hunt. Because every Goldchest beast you face will wish you came unprepared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras/64fc2a805d3561497f18b7366f48ca62.avif?t=1772180848\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras_big/64fc2a805d3561497f18b7366f48ca62.avif?t=1772180848 width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras/3f97cb00f18768b0f63b4358545ab97b.avif?t=1772180848\" width=800 height=497 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity and forge your own <strong>identity</strong> crafting the ultimate Goldchest Hunter! Dive into levels of customization,sculpt every detail from your face and skin texture to  jaw-dropping outfits. Design a Hunter as unique as your playstyle Whether you want to be a rugged wilderness , a sleek dark style, or a radiant hunter, the power is in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 The Hunt begins Bring back the lost shiny skies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras/f150e4ec7b553861db9693fd86bf6ec7.avif?t=1772180848\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/extras_big/f150e4ec7b553861db9693fd86bf6ec7.avif?t=1772180848 width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2389680?t=1772180848","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772180848","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/6df4594f6d888b71eac2ccd3335e54f2c79aefc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772180848","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389680/6df4594f6d888b71eac2ccd3335e54f2c79aefc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772180848","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4422680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"ht